<title>USA: Northern States' NRG acquires power plant.</title>
<headline>Northern States' NRG acquires power plant.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern States Power Co's NRG Energy Inc unit said Thursday it and its partner Decker Energy International Inc acquired a power plant in Michigan.</p>
<p>NRG did not disclose the purchase price. The facility is a 34 MW wood-fired steam turbine power plant located in Cadillac, Mich., and was sold to NRG by Beaver Michigan Associates LP.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
